BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Team -  it's tough to block time across our two organizations  
 with multiple markets\, but this may be the best availbility.   IF you can
  not attend\, we'll follow up with AI notes and follow up.\n\nThe purpose 
 of the call is to briefly review the new opportuntiy we have for Chambord 
 Incremental Funds and  we've selected IL & FL for Central's focus.  Below 
 is the message from the the Brands Team\, we can discuss any questions and
  more details on success metrics.\n\n\n"Our action plan is to unleash the 
 Always Add Chambord strategy that every brand\, every display\, every cock
 tail is a chance to grow Chambord.\n\nThe brand direction is simple...\n\n
   1.  Secure menu placements\n     *   This could look like adding Chambor
 d to an already-existing menu placement - "Woodford Reserve Manhattan feat
 uring Chambord"\n  2.  "Add On" displays\n     *   This could look like ad
 ding the 375ml hanging racks to already-existing displays\n\nTo support th
 ese efforts\, we will be transferring $15k to each market with the intenti
 on that you know what's best to drive results and will be able to use the 
