 g 401(k) catch-up changes for high earners\, and key considerations to ali
 gn with your long-term financial goals.\n\n- Maximize Health Resources: Le
 verage HSAs and FSAs to reduce out-of-pocket costs\, take advantage of tax
  savings\, and save strategically\n\n- What's New in 2026: Updates to heal
