 up-join/19%3ameeting_ODY3YzBmOGQtMDRiMi00MDI2LTkzMTgtOTI5M2YxNDM1ODcw%40th
 read.v2/0?context=%7b%22Tid%22%3a%22b0b1d46f-f0e1-4732-a328-e4176a2d0165%2
 2%2c%22Oid%22%3a%22a8ea24ef-02a8-4c10-b0d5-295288214e56%22%7d>\nMeeting ID
 : 226 551 965 312\nPasscode: zL7Aj62J\n________________________________\nD
 ial in by phone\n+1 914-348-3644\,\,346150781# United States\, Westchester
 \nFind a local number<https://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/3272a7e5-aa4d-475
 0-9ee2-8ff49dee0f51?id=346150781>\nPhone conference ID: 346 150 781#\nFor 
 organizers: Meeting options<https://teams.microsoft.com/meetingOptions/?or
 ganizerId=a8ea24ef-02a8-4c10-b0d5-295288214e56&tenantId=b0b1d46f-f0e1-4732
 -a328-e4176a2d0165&threadId=19_meeting_ODY3YzBmOGQtMDRiMi00MDI2LTkzMTgtOTI
 5M2YxNDM1ODcw@thread.v2&messageId=0&language=en-US> | Reset dial-in PIN<ht
 tps://dialin.teams.microsoft.com/usp/pstnconferencing>\n__________________
 ______________________________________________________________\nBBG & BF t
 eam\,\n\nI am scheduling a weekly call starting next Thursdays at 9:30am t
 o go over Jack Black Friday Progress.\n\nWE just conducted our BF ADS call
  and all hands on deck leading up to Jack Black Friday.\n\n\n·         Oc
 tober 31st – Deadline to assigned a Jack Black Friday Happy Hour Locatio
 n (1 per Market)\n\n·         BF ADS to take the lead (Seep Specs Below) 
 along with BBG & BF Sales leaders for account selection.\n·         Use t
 he link to update the account selection along with details:   F26 Jack Bla
 ck Friday Happy Hour Tracker.xlsx<https://skyappscsg.sharepoint.com/:x:/t/
 FLBusinessManagement/EYMMxAJQJZ5Oody7yOBqS4MBW5phZQsdyafLCKWoNR57Vw?e=wOQY
 rE>\n\n·         Bartender Kits are being sent to each house to be manage
 d by BF ADS & BF Market managers to support the Salesforce.   Will share s
 hipping information once they ship.\n\n\n·         BF ADs to lead the cha
 rge – You’ll drive the selection of the (7) iHub in each of your marke
 ts in close coordination with local BBG and BF sales leaders.  These will 
 be high-energy\, high-impact events that put Jack front and center.\n\n· 
         Happy Hour Location Selection by Friday October 31st.  (Pensacola\
 , Jacksonville\, Tampa\, Orlando\, Ft. Lauderdale\, Miami and Florida Keys
 )\n\n·         Accounts must feature Jack Daniels Black on a Happy Hour p
 romotion\n·         Back Bar Distribution:   Jack Black\, Jack Flavors (4
 )\, Jack Single Barrel (1)\, Jack Daniels Bond Series (1)\, Gentleman Jack
 .\n·         Primary and Secondary POS available and displayed at the acc
 ount.\n·         Jack Daniels Bartender Kits will be delivered to each ho
 use to activate participating accounts.\n·         Each market will be as
 signed a budget for the happy hour activation.   (Information will be send
  directly)\n\n\n\n
