BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Event Information: Monday\, January 26\, 11:00 AM Shotgun\, For
 t Lauderdale Country Club: https://conineallstargolfclassic.com/<https://c
 onineallstargolfclassic.com/>\n\n\n[cid:image001.png@01DC8C59.04B74590]\n\
 nConine Golf Classic Supporters\,\n\nWe look forward to seeing you for the
  32nd Annual Conine All-Star Golf Classic! Below are some event details we
  would like to share.\n\nMonday\, January 26\, 2026 at Fort Lauderdale Cou
 ntry Club (415 E Country Club Circle\, Plantation\, FL 33317)\nPlease note
  that the awards dinner start time is subject to weather and speed of play
 .\n\n  *   Registration: 8:00am\n  *   Breakfast: 8:00-10:00am\n  *   Golf
  Pro Shop Experience: 8:00-10:00am\n  *   Shotgun Start: 11:00am\n  *   Aw
 ards Dinner: 4:30pm\n\nUpon arrival\, please follow the directions of the 
 parking attendants.\n\nThere will be a silent auction with all items avail
 able for bid on Monday\, in-person only. Some of the items include:\n\n  *
    6-8-Night Cruise with Royal Caribbean\n  *   Panthers Suite for 15 with
  Food and Beverage\n  *   Getaway Vacations to Aruba and the Bahamas\n  * 
   Various pieces of Memorabilia\n  *   Fishing Charter for 3 people\n  *  
  Exclusive Golf Experience at Trump National Golf Club with Gene Sauers\n 
  *   Exclusive Golf Experience at The Bear’s Club with Jeff Conine\n  * 
   IMG Academy 1-Week Youth Sports Camp\n  *   Marlins Suite for 16 people 
 with Food and Beverage\n  *   & more!\n\nAdditional event details can be f
 ound HERE<https://linkprotect.cudasvc.com/url?a=https%3a%2f%2fconineallsta
 rgolfclassic.com%2f&c=E\,1\,gV1WpxYAnRjqdJA6NLlTc6aPdtKICBDysw8vt3w-ZmeEQC
 ROvMWgpBovjX3NbqfptRv00wh5RGEUzRKIleFIWcySIHdgZpmXfAN8Kkwt4MTIVG8Yn6vg5w\,
 \,&typo=1>.\n\nPlease feel free to share this email with the other players
  in your foursome as a reminder.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAttachments :\n\n  *   ima
 ge001.png<https://mail.google.com/?view=att&th=19beba02be7f88a4&attid=0.1&
 disp=attd&zw>\n\n\n
