BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:\nRegistration is officially open for the 2026 Chubb Classic pr
 esented by SERVPRO Pro-Am\, powered by EMC Lighting + Technology! Join us 
 Monday\, February 9\, on the Black Course at Tiburón Golf Club.\n\n\nTo h
 ave your group members register\, please simply forward this email to them
  and have them respond directly to me.\nTo register\, please send the foll
 owing information to tshrader@outlyr.com<mailto:tshrader@outlyr.com> by Th
 ursday\, February 5th.\n\n  *\nFirst & Last Name\n  *\nEmail Address\n  *\
 nGender\n  *\nWill you require rental clubs?\n     *\nIf yes\, Male or Fem
 ale - Right or Left Handed\n  *   Handicap Index\n     *   If you do not k
 now your handicap\, please send your last 5 scores\n  *   GHIN #\n  *   Ar
 e you planning on attending the Pro-Am Celebration on Tuesday\, February 1
 0th from 6:30pm – 9:30pm? If so\, will you be bringing a guest?\n\n Your
  deadline to send this information is Thursday\, February 5th.\nAs a remin
 der\, pairings will not be available until Sunday\, February 8th. Pairings
  and tee times will be emailed to you.\nIn this email\, you will also find
  three attachments:\nPro-Am Parking Pass: Please show this to park on-site
  Monday (2/9). All guests will valet their cars at the Clubhouse upon arri
 val.\nPro-Am Celebration Invitation: Please view this and RSVP to Taylor S
 hrader at tshrader@outlyr.com<mailto:tshrader@outlyr.com> by Thursday\, Fe
 bruary 5th.\nPro-Am Guidebook: This is a document containing information y
 ou will need as a participant. Please be sure to read through.\nRegistrati
 on + Gifting:\nRegistration: Valet\nWhen you check in on the day of play\,
  you will receive everything you need to participate in the Pro-Am\, inclu
 ding your credential\, bag tag\, and guest badge should you need one.\n\n 
  *\nStarting at11:00am\n\nGifting: Clubhouse – The Vault\n              
 Hours + Location:\n\n  *   Monday\, February 9th: 11:00am – 12:30pm\n  *
    Tuesday\, February 10th: 6:30pm – 9:30pm\n\nIf you have any questions
 \, please do not hesitate to reach out!\n\n\n\nJoin Google Meet:\nvideo:\n
 meet.google.com/pvu-ycqo-afk<https://meet.google.com/pvu-ycqo-afk>\n\nphon
 e:\n(US) +1 302-503-4487<tel:+1-302-503-4487>\nPIN: 671800297\n\nmore:\nht
 tps://tel.meet/pvu-ycqo-afk?pin=4719949958197\n\n
