DESCRIPTION:Hello Everyone\,\n\nWanted to find some time to chat through th
 is Private Club Membership that is in consideration as part of our F27 Win
  Miami strategy.\n\nHere is the link to the working document on locations 
 being considered:\nMIAMI PRIVATE MEMBER CLUBS<https://docs.google.com/spre
 adsheets/d/1PSVGtQwVKvSnNUKpaGBq8oXhW4dWc72Kg73WvL4uszM/edit?usp=sharing>\
 n\nAgenda attached\, but would ideally like to align on a A\, B\, and C op
 tion for membership funded from the brand side\, but that commercial would
  lead. Ideally want it to check all our marketing needs (trendy\, ability 
 to host media/influencers\, ability to host events)\, but also allow for c
 ommercial distribution and volume.\n\nIdeally we want to align this member
 ship with an account that the local team is already (or will be) actively 
 engaging\, allowing us to accelerate that existing relationship and maximi
 ze impact.\n\nFor options we do not move forward with\, let's also keep in
  consideration for tastemaker accounts for our Win Miami plan.\n\nLook for
 ward to chatting! Please add any additional BF stakeholders as needed.\n\n
 Will schedule a follow up as needed dependent on where we end up.\n\n\n\n\
 nAttachments :\n\n  *   MIAMI PRIVATE MEMBER CLUBS<https://docs.google.com
 /spreadsheets/d/1PSVGtQwVKvSnNUKpaGBq8oXhW4dWc72Kg73WvL4uszM/edit?usp=shar
 ing>\n  *   Notes - Diplo - Miami Private Club Alignment<https://docs.goog
 le.com/document/d/1w25srfXHR9RJlHXRHgilCFnIdB8fD2mM45BV-UXiv68/edit>\n\n\n
