BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Hi All\,\n\nPlease hold this time for our next all-team WR On-P
 rem Strategy Session!\n\nDuring this time\, we will hear a preliminary rep
 ort-out from the following workstreams:\n\n  1.  Advocacy\n  2.  Drink Str
 ategy\n  3.  Guest Programming\n\n\nWe will also spend a bit of time revie
 wing the next iteration of work from Segmentation and Distribution.\n\nPle
 ase come prepared to report out on your respective workstream (the progres
 s you've made since our kickoff 6 weeks ago\, your draft strategy\, and an
 y initial initiatives or big ideas that you want feedback on)\, and also b
 e prepared to engage\, ask questions and share feedback with the other gro
 ups.\n\n\nWe may not need the full 90 minutes\, but we will plan to start 
 on time at 10:30am ET.\n\nThanks in advance for your attendance and partic
 ipation\,\n-Ellie\n\n\n\nJoin Google Meet:\nvideo:\nmeet.google.com/uvd-hn
 wt-emt<https://meet.google.com/uvd-hnwt-emt>\n\nphone:\n(US) +1 218-301-27
