 T\, followed by a public conference call to discuss the results at 10:00 a
 .m. Listen live to the conference call\, hosted by President and CEO Lawso
 n Whiting\, EVP\, CFO Leanne Cunningham\, and VP\, Director\, Investor Rel
 ations Sue Perram.\n\nHelpful Tips:\n\nThe earnings release and slide deck
  will be available on March 4 by 8:00 a.m. EST at investors.brown-forman.c
 om<http://investors.brown-forman.com>.\n\nAn Earnings Call FAQ<https://inf
 ogram.com/1peg123dm9ekgptmj9zq16z99ytld5wvzx7> is available to explain wha
 t happens on the call and offers a guide to key financial terms to enhance
  your understanding of our business.\n\nA recording of the conference call
  will be available at investors.brown-forman.com<http://investors.brown-fo
 rman.com> a couple of hours after the call ends.\n\n\n\n\n\n
