BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:WRDO204668 - Indigo Road Hospitality- Corner Chophouse - 6 gues
 ts\n\nMarch 18 @ 2:15 PM EST\n\n\n2:00 pm EST - Arrive at Woodford Reserve
  Distillery\n\n*Turn in where the sign says Tours/Tastings and check in at
  the Gristmill House.\n\n2:15 pm EST - Ride shuttle van down to the distil
 lery with Host to begin Private Tour and thieve Single Barrel samples\n\n3
 :15 pm EST - Tasting and Selection Experience begins in the Pepper House\n
 \n4:15 pm EST - Visit Gift Shop & Depart\n\n*Please note that we have a sh
 uttle outside the gift shop to take you back across the street to the park
 ing lot.\n\n\nGUEST NOTES:\n\nAll guests must wear closed toe shoes and lo
 ng pants. We have changed the tour path to be more authentic and will be i
 n the warehouse thieving from barrels. For their safety\, all guests shoul
 d wear long pants and closed toe shoes.\n\n\nIf you are not attending\, pl
 ease provide a valid phone number for the group's primary contact.\n\nAll 
 guests for selection must be 21 or older and must have a valid government-
 issued ID with them to present at check-in.\n\n\nPlease confirm the headco
 unt for this group if you haven’t already and let me know if you have an
 y questions or if anything changes. The best way to reach me is through em
 ail. Thank you and I cannot wait to host this group!\n\nIndigo Road  3/18 
 at 2:15 pm\nBrand: Woodford Reserve\nSelection Type: Customer Visits Disti
 llery\nEvent SFID (Do not delete!): a51Vt00001C9leb\n\n\n\n
