BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:\nHi Central Team!\nReminder: The mandatory Accounting Year End
  Training is scheduled for Monday\, March 30\, at 1pm EST.  If you do not 
 have the invite\, please reach out\, and I will have Accounting add you.\n
 \n\nAs we near the end of F26\, it's time to prepare accruals for any outs
 tanding brand expenses related to F26 activity that won't be processed by 
 April 30\, 2026. To minimize manual accruals and tracking\, please clear a
 ll invoices and charges in Coupa and Concur ASAP—don't wait until the la
 st minute.\n\n\nLinked is the MRM Training Guide: F26 Year End Accruals In
 structions<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nfznTuik078VCeTvPpSCn5ZjhY1
 ArRE5SGlnKT3eka8/edit?usp=sharing>\, which provides a detailed walkthrough
  of the YE accrual process.  A few steps have been changed so please make 
 sure to refer to the guide.  Here are a few key steps:\n\n  *   Leverage M
 RM – You can select which open F26 activities should be accrued in MRM (
 detailed steps with screenshots are in the attached guide). The accrual re
 cords are located on the Funding Request tab under the F26 Accruals view. 
 Note that we are only accruing activities that are greater than $5K\, with
  exceptions outlined in the guide\,\n  *   Supporting Documentation – Up
 load your supporting documentation to the Central Year End Accruals<https:
 //drive.google.com/drive/folders/1v4UP4Lq5b-emEQCVCSj03WliMQRP6KUD?usp=dri
 ve_link> folder. Within each cluster folder\, you'll find your individual 
 folder for document uploads. Label and attach all supporting documents (Ex
 cel\, PDF\, PPT\, etc.) with the Accrual Reference Number (e.g.\, John Smi
 th-MR00000XXXXX).\n     *   Vendor/Distributor Invoices – Proper documen
 tation includes a copy of the invoice or a written estimate (email is acce
 ptable) from the vendor that establishes the timing of the expense\, servi
 ces rendered\, and dollar value of the accrual. Where available\, please i
 nclude the Vendor Name and Invoice Number in MRM.\n     *   Distributor In
 centives – Please use the F26 Dist Incentives Accruals Template<https://
 docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_4SbF6f_qIH5supXcA2t6rhH8ySuYJIkZGB-NAjoXv
 Q/edit?usp=sharing> to summarize all outstanding incentives for each marke
 t/distributor combination.\n        *   Once summarized\, the State Manage
 r will share the summary with their distributor counterpart using the sugg
 ested email communication in the tracker and include a screenshot of distr
 ibutor confirmation (email is sufficient) in their respective year-end goo
 gle folder.\n        *   Note: The email confirmation will ONLY suffice fo
 r the incentive accrual support. When incentives are paid out in F27\, Int
 ernal Audit will still require the standard detailed support validating th
 e incentive\, as detailed in the attached guide.\n\n\nAll accruals must be
  finalized in MRM\, and supporting documentation submitted to your individ
 ual Google folder by EOD Wednesday\, April 22nd to allow Finance time to r
 eview.\n\n\n\nHere's a summary of the key F26 year-end dates:\n\nDescripti
 on\n\nAction\n\nDeadline\n\nAP\n & AR Invoicing\n\n•Contact vendors/dist
 ributors to submit invoices for F26 expenses to AP/AR by Wed 4/15. Invoice
 s coded and approved after the 15th are not guaranteed to be processed in 
 F26.\n\n• Invoices will continue to be processed\n for SAP posting throu
 gh Wed 4/22. Invoices coded and approved after 4/22 will be posted in F27\
 n\n\n\n\n\n5pm ET Weds\n\nApril 15\n\n\n\nConcur\n\n• Approve and submit
  all outstanding\n Concur Reports by Thur 4/30 5PM ET.\n\n• Please do no
 t submit items that are normally processed through Concur as part of your 
 MRM accruals. These expenses are extracted from Concur and Citibank to be 
 accrued in a separate process.\n\n5pm\n ET Thur\n\nApril 30\n\nProduct Pro
 motion\n\n• The last day to purchase Product Promotion on your Corporate
  Card is Fri 4/10. Purchases after this date should be submitted as cash '
 out of pocket expense' in Concur\n• The\n last day to purchase Product P
 romotion on your Personal Credit Card OR Cash is Thur 4/30.  Purchases aft
 er this date will be charged against your F27 Product Promotion balance.\n
 \n• You must submit an expense report and have it "approved" and "sent f
 or\n payment" by Fri 4/30 at 5PM ET for it to be included in F26.\n\n• C
 lick here<https://docs.google.com/document/d/13v4PI7bag6ATI7-9YXdJCcktAXEa
 HR4hUu7gvOi_Goo/edit?usp=sharing> for instructions\n on checking your prod
 uct promotion balance.\n\nFri\n\nApril 10\n(Corporate Visa)\n\nThur\n\n Ap
 ril 30\n(Personal CC or CASH)\n\nAccrual Submission for Outstanding TMF\n\
 n• All accruals must be finalized\n in MRM and supporting documentation 
 submitted by Weds 4/22.\n\n5pm ET Weds\n\nApril 22\n\n\n\nI know this is a
  lot to absorb. If you have any questions about expenses related to either
  F26 or F27\, please don't hesitate to reach out to Adrian Ramirez or me. 
 Feel free to schedule some time on our calendars for you and/or your team.
  We’re here to help ensure a smooth and successful close to F26!  #Centr
 alLeads\n\n\n\n\n\nJoin Google Meet:\nvideo:\nmeet.google.com/kfm-zjwj-nqu
 <https://meet.google.com/kfm-zjwj-nqu>\n\nphone:\n(US) +1 385-404-5131<tel
 :+1-385-404-5131>\nPIN: 562243727\n\nmore:\nhttps://tel.meet/kfm-zjwj-nqu?
 pin=8531619461274\n\n
UID:32gnc7dnb6a1g8pos65a91jttm@google.com
