 s\n  *\nCrew drives\, blitzes\, surveys\n  *\nSpecial events\n\nImportant:
 \n\n  *\nAny special event requests\, crew drives\, blitzes or surveys mus
 t already be planned and approved with your Business Manager prior to subm
 ission\n  *   No happy hours should be submitted through this form\n\nKey 
 guidelines:\n\n  *   Requests due by the 15th of the month\, two months pr
 ior\n(Example: January requests due November 15)\n  *\nSubmission does not
  guarantee approval (invites approvals will be sent 30 days prior to the r
 equested month.\n  *   Tuesday–Thursday only\; no requests during the la
 st week of the month\n  *   Maximum of 3 requests per market per month\n(M
 iramar\, Tampa\, Orlando\, Jacksonville\, Pensacola)\n  *   All Work With 
 activities including samples will be charged back at 100%\n  *   Blackout 
 dates: November 1 – January 5\n\nAll market activity must be submitted t
 hrough this form to be considered.\nThank you for your partnership and pla
 nning accordingly.\n\n\n\n\n\n
