DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our next All Brown-Forman Business Briefing.
  These briefings offer an important opportunity for us to gather as one gl
 obal team to hear directly from leadership about our quarterly business pe
 rformance\, discuss key priorities shaping our work\, and stay connected t
 o our shared direction as a company.\n\nClick here<https://vimeo.com/event
 /2711272> to access the All Brown-Forman Business Briefing.\n\nPassword: B
 FBB2026\n\nPlease note: A rebroadcast will not be scheduled for the Asia P
 acific markets beginning this quarter to allow local teams to organize the
  most convenient time to view the recording together\, where appropriate.\
 n\nTranslations: Translations will be provided in 11 languages via closed 
 captioning through the Wordly service. Access the Wordly service for this 
 event here<https://attend.wordly.ai/join/YZKX-0553>. Please see the instru
 ctions here<https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RGfTb6SFqM8zby0Lcd22yi
 fsl7E6mjX5?usp=sharing> for more details on how to access the Wordly close
 d captioning and live audio/voice translations.\n\nA recording will be sha
 red for those unable to join the live event.\n\n\n\n\n\n
