BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:As a salaried employee of Brown-Forman\, you are invited to att
 end the 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders.\n\nThe meeting will be held o
 n July 23\, 2026\, at 9:30 a.m. EDT at Churchill Downs.\n\nWATCH THE LIVES
 TREAM: A livestream of the event will be broadcast for employees from 9:30
  to approximately 10:30 a.m. EDT.\n\nWatch Livestream<https://vimeo.com/sh
 owcase/11806130?event=6051819&video=1209897159> (Password: AnnualMeeting20
 26)\n\nTranslations will be provided in 11 languages offered in the closed
  captioning through the Wordly service. Access the Wordly service for this
  event here<https://attend.wordly.ai/join/FEWG-7039>. Please see the instr
 uctions here <https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RGfTb6SFqM8zby0Lcd22
 yifsl7E6mjX5> for more details on how to access the Wordly closed captioni
 ng and live audio/voice translations.\n\nIN PERSON ATTENDANCE: Advance reg
 istration for in-person attendance is now closed. If you registered in adv
 ance\, you should have received a confirmation email with parking and chec
 k-in details. Please note that seating is limited. Employees who did not r
 egister in advance may still be admitted if seats are available by present
 ing a Brown-Forman employee photo I.D.\n\nWATCH A RECORDING: A recording w
 ill be available to the public 24 hours after the event at ams.b-f.com.\n\
 nPlease direct any questions to Investor Relations at investor_relations@b
 -f.com.\n\n
