BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:WRDO204880 - Damn Good Hospitality - 8 guests\n\nJuly 28 @ 10:1
 5 AM EST\n\n\n10:00 am EST - Arrive at Woodford Reserve Distillery\, 7855 
 McCracken Pike\, Versailles\, KY\n\n*Turn in where the sign says Tours/Tas
 tings and check in at the Gristmill House.\n\n10:15 am EST - Ride shuttle 
 van down to the distillery with Host to begin Private Tour and thieve Sing
 le Barrel samples\n\n11:15 am EST - Tasting and Selection Experience begin
 s in the Pepper House\n\n12:15 pm EST - Visit Gift Shop & Depart\n\n*Pleas
 e note that we have a shuttle outside the gift shop to take you back acros
 s the street to the parking lot.\n\n\nGUEST NOTES:\n\nAll guests must wear
  closed toe shoes and long pants. We have changed the tour path to be more
  authentic and will be in the warehouse thieving from barrels. For their s
 afety\, all guests should wear long pants and closed toe shoes.\n\n\nIf yo
 u are not attending\, please provide a valid phone number for the group's 
 primary contact.\n\nAll guests for selection must be 21 or older and must 
 have a valid government-issued ID with them to present at check-in.\n\n\nP
 lease confirm the headcount for this group if you haven’t already and le
 t me know if you have any questions or if anything changes. The best way t
 o reach me is through email. Thank you and I cannot wait to host this grou
 p!\n\n\nDistillery Visit 7/28 at 10:15 am\nBrand: Woodford Reserve\nSelect
 ion Type: Customer Visits Distillery\nEvent SFID (Do not delete!): a51Vt00
 001FCIOL\n\n\n\n
