BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Click Here to Listen to the Live Conference Call on Sept. 2\, 2
 026.<https://edge.media-server.com/mmc/p/yp7dva3n/>\n\nBrown-Forman's FY27
  Q1 financial results will be released on Sept. 2\, 2026\, by 8:00 a.m. ED
 T\, followed by a public conference call to discuss the results at 10:00 a
 .m. Listen live to the conference call\, hosted by President and CEO Lawso
 n Whiting\; EVP\, CFO Jim Peters\; and VP\, Director\, Investor Relations 
 Sue Perram.\n\nHelpful Tips:\nThe earnings release and slide deck will be 
 available on Sept. 2 by 8:00 a.m. EDT at <http://investors.brown-forman.co
 m> investors.brown-forman.com<http://investors.brown-forman.com>.\n\nAn Ea
 rnings Call FAQ<https://infogram.com/1peg123dm9ekgptmj9zq16z99ytld5wvzx7> 
 is available to explain what happens on the call and offers a guide to key
  financial terms to enhance your understanding of our business.\n\nA recor
 ding of the conference call will be available at investors.brown-forman.co
 m<http://investors.brown-forman.com> a couple of hours after the call ends
 .\n\n
