DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our next All Brown-Forman Business Briefing.
  These briefings offer an important opportunity for us to gather as one gl
 obal team to hear directly from leadership about our quarterly business pe
 rformance\, discuss key priorities shaping our work\, and stay connected t
 o our shared direction as a company.\nClick here<https://vimeo.com/event/2
 711272> to access the All Brown-Forman Business Briefing.\nPassword: BFBB2
 026\n\nTranslations: Translations will be provided in 11 languages via clo
 sed captioning through the Wordly service. Access the Wordly service for t
 his event here<https://attend.wordly.ai/join/YZKX-0553>. Please see the in
 structions here<https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RGfTb6SFqM8zby0Lcd
 22yifsl7E6mjX5?usp=sharing> for more details on how to access the Wordly c
 losed captioning and live audio/voice translations.\n\nRecording: A record
 ing will be shared for those unable to join the live event.\n\n\n
