BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Team USA & Canada\,\nWhile we are now fully immersed in FY27\, 
 we’d still like to take the opportunity to celebrate the outstanding ach
 ievements of the last fiscal year. Despite continuing to navigate a challe
 nging environment\, we saw excellent examples of dedication and determinat
 ion across our teams. With that\, we are excited to invite you to our virt
 ual FY26 USA&C Awards Ceremony.\nPlease click here<https://vimeo.com/showc
 ase/9908515?event=2525187&video=1089123348> (PW: USAC2026) to join the liv
 e event on Thursday\, September 10\, from 3:00-4:00 p.m. ET.\nCheers!\nUSA
  & Canada Leadership Team\n
