BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION: WRDO204876 - Ocean Reef Club - 6 guests\nOctober 20 @ 2:15 PM 
 EST\n\n2:00 pm EST - Arrive at Woodford Reserve Distillery\n*Turn in where
  the sign says Tours/Tastings and check in at the Gristmill House.\n2:15 p
 m EST - Ride shuttle van down to the distillery with Host to begin Private
  Tour and thieve Single Barrel samples\n3:15 pm EST - Tasting and Selectio
 n Experience begins in the Pepper House\n4:15 pm EST - Visit Gift Shop & D
 epart\n*Please note that we have a shuttle outside the gift shop to take y
 ou back across the street to the parking lot.\n\nGUEST NOTES:\nAll guests 
 must wear closed toe shoes and long pants. We have changed the tour path t
 o be more authentic and will be in the warehouse thieving from barrels. Fo
 r their safety\, all guests should wear long pants and closed toe shoes.\n
 \nIf you are not attending\, please provide a valid phone number for the g
 roup's primary contact.\nAll guests for selection must be 21 or older and 
 must have a valid government-issued ID with them to present at check-in.\n
 \nPlease confirm the headcount for this group if you haven’t already and
  let me know if you have any questions or if anything changes. The best wa
 y to reach me is through email. Thank you and I cannot wait to host this g
 roup!\n\n\n
